*> vybe-test: cobol/move_group_redefines/redefines_preserves_original_value
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_move_group_redefines.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 ORIG PIC X(5) VALUE "HELLO".
01 ALSO-ORIG REDEFINES ORIG PIC X(5).
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY ORIG.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING ORIG DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "HELLO"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [HELLO] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY ALSO-ORIG.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING ALSO-ORIG DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "HELLO"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [HELLO] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

